Delete all data from DMP database and images

Usage: nuke [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --y                Skip confirmation prompt
      --keep-artist-img  Keep artist images (local files and S3 objects under artists/)
      --only <ONLY>      Delete only matching artist(s) - semicolon-separated, exact match
      --dry-run          Show what would be deleted without making any changes
  -h, --help             Print help
